&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-indent:0pt;line-height:5pt;"&gt;　&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12.5pt;"&gt;　(2) 当社設立以降&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-indent:0pt;line-height:3pt;font-size:3pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
